  "emails": [
    {
      "subject": "Your Site answer has a new comment",
      "text": "user7,

Your answer on Site has a new comment by user9:


comment number 4


Your answer was:


answer number 2


You may respond by adding your own comment:

http://site.test/1/question-title-here?show=4#c4

Thank you,

Site

",
      "to": "u7@x.test",
    },
